{"t":"FCX","made":"2026-11-10 08:51","name":"Freeport-McMoRan Inc.","ko":"프리포트맥모란","sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Copper","employees":29000,"hq":"Phoenix, AZ, United States","website":"https://fcx.com","summary_en":"Freeport-McMoRan Inc. engages in the mining of mineral properties in North America, South America, and Indonesia. The company primarily explores for copper, gold, molybdenum, silver, and other metals. Its assets include the Grasberg minerals district in Indonesia; Morenci, Bagdad, Safford, Sierrita, and Miami in Arizona; Chino and Tyrone in New Mexico; and Henderson and Climax in Colorado, North America, as well as Cerro Verde in Peru and El Abra in Chile. The company was formerly known as Freeport-McMoRan Copper & Gold Inc. and changed its name to Freeport-McMoRan Inc. in July 2014. The company was incorporated in 1987 and is headquartered in Phoenix, Arizona.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Freeport-McMoRan Inc.는 북미, 남미 및 인도네시아에서 광물 채굴에 종사하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 주로 구리, 금, 몰리브덴, 은 및 기타 금속을 탐색합니다. 그 자산에는 인도네시아의 Grasberg 광물 지역이 포함됩니다. 애리조나주의 모렌시, 바그다드, 새포드, 시에리타, 마이애미; 뉴멕시코의 치노(Chino)와 타이론(Tyrone); 북미 콜로라도의 Henderson과 Climax, 페루의 Cerro Verde, 칠레의 El Abra 등이 있습니다. 이 회사는 이전에 Freeport-McMoRan Copper & Gold Inc.로 알려졌으며 2014년 7월에 이름을 Freeport-McMoRan Inc.로 변경했습니다. 이 회사는 1987년에 설립되었으며 애리조나주 피닉스에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":62.33,"mcap":89439567872.0,"pe":26.189075,"fpe":14.601669,"peg":3.4381,"ps":3.382481,"pb":4.2630463,"ev_ebitda":10.854,"div":1.01,"beta":1.373,"hi52":80.24,"lo52":38.85},"fin":{"rev":26442000384.0,"rev_g":0.082,"eps_g":0.761,"gross":0.38854998,"op":0.35264,"net":0.13029,"roe":0.15719,"fcf":1867000064.0,"cash":4335000064.0,"debt":10355999744.0,"de":30.81,"eps":2.38,"feps":4.26869},"own":{"short":0.0183,"inst":0.92487,"insider":0.0073400005},"analyst":{"n":22,"mean":78.08636,"median":81.5,"high":90.0,"low":33.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":1.78261,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":6,"buy":12,"hold":4,"sell":1,"strongSell":0},{"index":